      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "+1 from me. I don't care about graphics quality -- I'd be more than happy with graphics that look like Doom or Wolfenstein, if I could run a version of VRchat standalone on a headset that worked with non-Quest-compatible worlds.\n\nI actually tried buying a gaming laptop just to run VRchat on. It's a lousy experience, and the laptop sits in a corner and doesn't get used. Standalone on Quest is a much better experience, but then you can't go to non-Quest-compatible worlds.\n\nVRchat folks: Please reconsider this. It's not about the graphics quality, it's about the ability to go to non-Quest-compatible worlds.",
